SD-RAG , a flexible mechanism for selective disclosure in retrieval-augmented generation pipelines that is resilient to prompt injection attacks;
a dedicated graph-based data model to represent the data corpus and the security/privacy constraints;
a novel mechanism to allow the ingestion of dynamic human-readable security/privacy constraints;
an enhanced retrieval strategy to extract relevant content along with associated security and privacy constraints;
